course: dictionary
lesson: 7684
title: What is protein?
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Protein is a nutrient in food. Your body uses it to grow, build muscles and repair itself when you get hurt. Hair, nails, skin and muscles are all made of proteins, so your body needs some protein every day.
explain: You find protein in meat, fish, eggs, milk, cheese, beans, lentils, nuts and tofu. «After sport the body needs to refuel and repair; carbs and some protein, such as a sandwich, pasta, yoghurt or milk, help recovery.» So protein helps your body recover after a game.
explain: Protein also means one particular kind of substance made inside living things. «Rotten eggs smell because bacteria break down proteins with sulphur in them.» Here proteins are the substances inside the egg, not the nutrient you eat.
fact: Protein is a nutrient: your body uses it to grow, build muscles and repair itself.
fact: A balanced plate has protein, carbohydrates for energy, fruit and vegetables, and a little fat.
fact: Good sources of protein include meat, fish, eggs, milk, cheese, beans, lentils, nuts and tofu.
fact: «Spider silk» is stronger than steel for its weight, because its proteins are lined up in a special way.
fact: «Lime juice» can unfold proteins, which is why fish soaked in it turns white without being heated.
exercise: Which food is a good source of protein? | Fizzy juice | White sugar | Lollipop | *Eggs
exercise: Why does your body need protein? | *To grow and repair itself | To keep your bedroom tidy | To make the sun shine | To run faster than the wind
exercise: In «Rotten eggs smell because bacteria break down proteins with sulphur in them», what are proteins? | Gases in the air | Tiny bugs that live in eggs | *Substances made inside living things | Sweet drinks
test: Name a food from this list that is a good source of protein: milk, crisps, sweets. | sweets | *milk | crisps
test: After sport, what helps your body recover, according to the text? | Sitting still for an hour | Only sweets | *A sandwich, pasta, yoghurt or milk | Cold water alone
exam: Which of these is the best reason to eat protein after playing football? | *It helps your muscles recover and repair | It stops you ever feeling thirsty again | It makes you taller overnight | It turns your skin into metal
